      "statement": "rerank_documents skips reranking when 3 or fewer chunks were retrieved, otherwise asks an LLM (SystemSetting key mentor_reranker, default gpt-4o-mini) to reorder chunk indices by relevance and keeps the top 3, falling back to the first 3 original chunks if parsing or the LLM call fails.",
