      "id": "claim_84f57898df0a43239c7a2ddd786c8a44",
      "statement": "agents/wiki is a periodic background job started from FastAPI's lifespan (api/main.py) that uses APScheduler's AsyncIOScheduler with an IntervalTrigger of settings.wiki.sync_interval_hours (WikiSettings, default 12) to run sync_wiki, is idempotent via add_job(replace_existing=True), and additionally runs an immediate one-off bootstrap sync job when the wiki_embeddings collection is found empty (including when the underlying PGVector tables do not yet exist) so wiki chat has content before the first interval elapses.",
      "evidence": [
